                <pb facs="0790" n="666" sameAs="frus:frus1921v01/pg666"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">818.032/40: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Costa Rica</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Thurston</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San José</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-11-06T08:00:00-06:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 6,
                                1921—8 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 8:05 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>130. My 129, October 24, 9 a.m. President Acosta last night signed decree
                    convoking Congress to extra sessions to begin November 14th to deal with
                    proposed loan from Royal Bank of Canada.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thurston</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
